The '''Sky Fruit''' is a [[Fruit Treasures|Fruit Treasure]] found in [[Into the Future]]. It improves the effect of most [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] [[Special Abilities|abilities]].

==Effect==
At 100% on all Sky Fruit Treasures, the following [[Special Abilities|abilities]] are enhanced when used against [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating Enemies]]:
{{Fruit Treasures Effect}}

